                    <span style="height:22px;padding:0 8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border-radius:6px;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #FFD8BE;font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#C2410C">⚑ {v.f}</span>
