            <span style="display:flex;gap:12px;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#3A302A"><span style="flex:none;font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#C2410C;padding-top:2px">03</span>Add the right listing by URL from the product page or the dashboard, and it's tracked from the next refresh.</span>
